{"game": "crab-champions", "language": "english", "appid": 774801, "month": "2023-12", "window": 1, "start_date": 1701388800, "end_date": 1701993599, "month_true_total": 635, "quota": 8, "returned": 8, "pulled_at": "2026-09-30 05:47:57 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "153081394", "author": {"steamid": "76561198379887336", "personaname": "Phil McKraken", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/blooptev/", "num_games_owned": 21, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 13531, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6554, "last_played": 1787447931, "avatar": "777d8c934167beef4665a9af275b008cfd2b5dc8"}, "language": "english", "review": "crab", "timestamp_created": 1701992419, "timestamp_updated": 1701992419, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153076891", "author": {"steamid": "76561198974232764", "personaname": "Thedyingjokepastaway", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198974232764/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1469, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1142, "last_played": 1713215978, "avatar": "2648b8bf2a176645c47b8002c0dc0be6e7f9af05"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's dumb, and fun. I mean you play a CRAB WITH GUNS, what more do you want? Other than that you have full control over the difficulty of the game, and you can choose to toggle a lot of parameters that ever so slightly change your experience. So, wether you are a veteran of roguelikes and shooting games or just a casual gamer looking for dumb fun, this game can more than accomodate your needs. It might not be a game you will play often, but you will have a blast every single time you do!", "timestamp_created": 1701987822, "timestamp_updated": 1701988452, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153069742", "author": {"steamid": "76561198013088584", "personaname": "Perfect Specimen", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198013088584/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2599, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2255, "last_played": 1718363782, "avatar": "d304d5464b90b1f3a634222d470471e0f587dd43"}, "language": "english", "review": "Edit: After this latest update the game somehow feels worse. None of the core issues were fixed and instead there are even more useless perks which make it even more difficult to put together something cohesive. I'm constantly finding myself restarting runs because only 2 out of 30 perks actually do anything. You used to be able to at least find something half decent in the shop but now you're limited to 1 or 2 blue purchases. Enemies require good damage perks to kill starting in ice world but that means you can't take health chests so you just get one shot by an offscreen projectile or a bunch of crabs spawning right under you. Can't recommend this game at the moment", "timestamp_created": 1701981744, "timestamp_updated": 1703912637, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153065172", "author": {"steamid": "76561198153118322", "personaname": "SpaceJesusCosmic", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/spacejesuscosmic/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 2067, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1904, "last_played": 1704943625, "avatar": "e33208323d2bdac767e10a88326f946ae2271a84"}, "language": "english", "review": "crabs", "timestamp_created": 1701978493, "timestamp_updated": 1701978493, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153053183", "author": {"steamid": "76561199016432361", "personaname": "Bob", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199016432361/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 4134, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 741, "last_played": 1778879880, "avatar": "cde80f50ba4fa74abbd3f7b2b44354ef8e3b1685"}, "language": "english", "review": "ITS SOOO GOOOD PLAY IT NOW PLS ITS WORTH THE MONEY", "timestamp_created": 1701965737, "timestamp_updated": 1701965737, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153037322", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071258259", "personaname": "TTVTheBeeKiiᴴᴵᴹ", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bloopblipbleep/", "num_games_owned": 352, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 30853, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 394, "playtime_at_review": 3875, "last_played": 1789948533, "avatar": "08ad50546e4af1d9436f44486149fdcd491e3e9b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Roguelites are amazing, roguelites with bright colors and a meme? Sign me up", "timestamp_created": 1701944074, "timestamp_updated": 1701944074, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153035022", "author": {"steamid": "76561199228835532", "personaname": "the alchemist", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199228835532/", "num_games_owned": 53, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 86411, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 397, "playtime_at_review": 4647, "last_played": 1790373429, "avatar": "b2edbc430cffa963966ebafc9e7844414a9c51c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "filthy creb", "timestamp_created": 1701939765, "timestamp_updated": 1701939765, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153026263", "author": {"steamid": "76561198104387027", "personaname": "Praif", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Praifendiac/", "num_games_owned": 1433, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 13080, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5665, "last_played": 1788029160, "avatar": "1dc1a61530360383a03c6cf9826f5372cc56f0e9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Crab Champions is a very goofy, very fun, Also very stressful Rouge-like, Especially when you are trying to get 100% completion. I just got it all the way there and grinded out all of the achievements over the last couple of weeks. It was very fun and enjoyable all the way through. The one 2 i struggled to get the most was beating a boss with 5 UNIQUE Greed perks. The game doesn't tell you they have to be unique it cant be 5 of 1 kind. But thats ok,  I got it and it was very fun doing so. The other one was not taking any damage in the first biome while on nightmare mode. It took a lot of tries and some frustration but i got it. Over all the experience of completed the game was very good. I love the game and definitely recommend this game. a good 8/10", "timestamp_created": 1701922890, "timestamp_updated": 1706160144, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504716992378234863", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}]}